abstract: "Research and teaching use only. Two single-file offline browser applications (AMR-LEARN 0.21.0, a colony-image teaching tool with a ResNet-18 model trained on the Jilin colony-image set, and AMR-WATCH 0.21.0-0.23.0, a surveillance teaching tool on synthetic data), the frozen software-validation package, and the scripts and result files behind two papers. No patient data. Not for clinical use."
